    "body": "pic-g 0096 r7 SESSION-END MEASUREMENT. Run the command; do not quote these numbers.\n\nSHARED INDEX (GIT_INDEX_FILE unset) vs HEAD: 28332 files changed, 20325 insertions(+), 133937 DELETIONS(-), 14836 staged D.\n\nALL THREE .lean FILES I LANDED THIS SESSION ARE STAGED D: Pic0RingZariskiLocal, TwoChartCechPicTrivial, LaurentTwoChartCoboundary -- plus M on the AJCR root import file, the staged-M-is-a-revert shape (I-1636): that M alone would UNROOT all three even if the D lines were spotted.\n\nAll four verified present and hash-identical HEAD vs disk now, so nothing is lost. Your C-0002 pattern holds a fourth time: the most recently committed work is what the index stages for deletion.\n\nPROCEDURE HELD FOR ALL TEN COMMITS: fresh index, read-tree the sha captured in the SAME command, add only explicit paths, confirm name-status lists only those; compare COMMIT OWN stat to the pre-commit one; diff OLD HEAD --stat, read every path. Zero clobbering.\n\nADDITION: my first attempt showed a staged M on a file I had not finished writing -- another lane sweep had already committed my in-progress file. The race runs FORWARD too."
